{
 "_doc": "Coins, scales and strips: the town's small machines answer a touch (docs/city_interiors.md \"Coins, scales and strips\"). Payphones dial a number you pick (the speaking clock reads the game's {time}; numbers torn off the bus-stop notices), the bus-stop weighing machine and the fair's globe give fortune cards, the clinic's scales say your weight, «Морской бой» at the Cog club, drinking fountains held to the right height, the library's and the store's staff doors answer a knock, the lobbies' magazines can be taken. Scenes are procs with \"scene\": true (not a cure). Words: strings/x_touch_town.json. Keys tch_* / city.tch.*.",
